### -------------------------------------------------------------
### FINANCE DASHBOARD API - TEST SUITE
### Required VS Code Extension: "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### =============================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### =============================================================
GET http://localhost:5000/
Content-Type: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:5000/health
Content-Type: application/json


### =============================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & TOKENS
### =============================================================

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@financeapp.dev",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### (Run the above login request first. The token will be saved to a variable automatically)
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

# @name loginAnalyst
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "analyst@financeapp.dev",
  "password": "Analyst@12345"
}
###
@analystToken = {{loginAnalyst.response.body.token}}

# @name loginViewer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "viewer@financeapp.dev",
  "password": "Viewer@12345"
}
###
@viewerToken = {{loginViewer.response.body.token}}


### =============================================================
### 3. USER MANAGEMENT (Only Admin can manage other users)
### =============================================================

# Get my own profile (Works for any role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get All Users (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =============================================================
### 4. DASHBOARD ANALYTICS (Available to all roles)
### =============================================================

# Get complete dashboard summary (Totals, Category Breakdown, Recent Activity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter dashboard by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =============================================================
### 5. FINANCE RECORDS (Admins = CRUD, Analysts/Viewers = Read Only)
### =============================================================

# List Finance Records (Pagination & Sorting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance?page=1&limit=5&sort=-date
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Filter Records by Type (Income or Expense)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance?type=INCOME
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### CREATE Record - Successful (Admin Token)
# @name createRecord
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 7500,
  "type": "INCOME",
  "category": "Bonus",
  "date": "2026-01-15T00:00:00Z",
  "note": "Yearly completion bonus"
}
###
@newRecordId = {{createRecord.response.body.data._id}}

### UPDATE Record
PUT {{baseUrl}}/finance/{{newRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 8000,
  "note": "Updated bonus amount"
}

### DELETE Record (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/finance/{{newRecordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### =============================================================
### 6. ACCESS CONTROL NEGATIVE TESTS (To prove RBAC works!)
### =============================================================

### 1. Try to view dashboard without token (Should fail - 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary

### 2. Analyst tries to GET users list (Should fail - 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{analystToken}}

### 3. Viewer tries to CREATE a finance record (Should fail - 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "category": "Pizza",
  "date": "2026-01-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### 4. Admin tries to create a record with bad data (Validation test - 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -500,
  "type": "INVALID_TYPE"
}
